... His last novel, Judas, was shortlisted for the Booker Prize in 2017 and won the Yasnaya Polyana Foreign Fiction Award. He received several international awards, including the Prix Femina, the Israel Prize, the Goethe Prize, the Frankfurt Peace Prize and the 2013 Franz Kafka Prize. He died in ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cbc.ca/books/30-books-to-celebrate-30-years-of-writers-company-1.5755144\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d45\"},\"ref\":\"d45\",\"snippet\":\" ... The shortlist for the 2024 Booker Prize featured five women and authors from five countries with Orbital by Samantha Harvey named the winner of the Booker Prize 2024. Harvey's novel takes place over a single day in the life of six astronauts and cosmonauts aboard the International ... \",\"title\":\"https://bookclubs.com/blog/2023-2024-book-awards-and-book-prize-winners\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d57\"},\"ref\":\"d57\",\"snippet\":\" ... Books by non-white authors have over seven times the likelihood of shortlisting compared to other books (OR: 7.68; p < 0.05). In turn, a book by a non-white author has over 10 times the likelihood of winning the Booker prize compared to other books (OR ... \",\"title\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10837049/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d30\"},\"ref\":\"d30\",\"snippet\":\" ... Taylor |\\n| 2003 The Booker Prizes |url= |access-date=2022-10-19 |website=thebookerprizes.com |language=en |archive-date=28 November 2022 |archive-url= |url-status=live }} | Shortlist | Damon Galgut | The Good Doctor | Atlantic Books | *John Carey (Chair) *A. C. Grayling *Francine Stock * Rebecca Stephens MBE *D. J. Taylor .