",\"snippet\":\" ... Prize for Fiction.)\\n* Oryx and Crake (2003, finalist for the 2003 Booker Prize and the 2003 Governor General's Award and shortlisted for the 2004 Orange Prize for Fiction.)\\n* The Penelopiad (2005, nominated for the 2006 Mythopoeic Fantasy Award for Adult Literature and longlisted for the 2007 International ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Margaret_Atwood\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"5631dafaa20366eb0235cdbba1ac4aa7ba65cf38fa7b9e994237c1fbecd0c13c\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"4c754a98ffcc7028dc07ecab5e7eb93b901d4f871ea7f8eb1f7b2a5c3a4dd34d\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"International Booker Prize 2016 shortlist six books\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d86\"},\"ref\":\"d86\",\"snippet\":\" ... Conditional' in her 2001 Booker shortlisted novel Hotel World – lines which could only be written by one who knows:\\n\\nAbout you – continued…\\n\\nIf you need help filling out this form, or any part of it, phone…\\n\\nTell us about yourself.\\n\\nWell. I am a nice person.\\n\\nThe protagonist ... \",\"title\":\"https://emmaashmere.com/category/on-writing/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d5\"},\"ref\":\"d5\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2016, the award was significantly reconfigured, and is now given annually to a single book in English translation, with a £50,000 prize for the winning title, shared equally between author and translator. The award has been known as the International Booker Prize since the Man Group ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Booker_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d37\"},\"ref\":\"d37\",\"snippet\":\" ... who won the 2016 Man Booker International Prize for her translation of The Vegetarian by Korean author Han Kang\\n\\nIt's of particular importance to note that the winning International Booker Prize comes from an independent press.\\n\\nIn a news conference earlier today, International Booker Prize jury chair ... \",\"title\":\"https://publishingperspectives.com/2022/05/geetanjali-shree-and-daisy-rockwell-win-the-international-booker-prize/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d30\"},\"ref\":\"d30\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2016 The Booker Prizes |url= |url-status=live |archive-url= |archive-date=6 February 2023 |access-date=2022-10-19 |website=thebookerprizes.com |language=en}} | Shortlist | David Szalay | All That Man Is | Jonathan Cape | * Amanda Foreman (chair) * Jon Day * David Harsent * Olivia Williams * Abdulrazak Gurnah |\\n| 2016 The Booker ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_winners_and_nominated_authors_of_the_Booker_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d57\"},\"ref\":\"d57\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2021; Lauter 1991; Nishikawa 2021; Sapiro 2016). Although in our data non-white authors disproportionately shortlist for and win the Booker prize (and over the period also make up a bigger share of the nominations), in a supplementary analysis we find that publishers who were regularly submitting to ... \",\"title\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10837049/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d87\