of Tristan Smith ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peter_Carey_(novelist)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d29\"},\"ref\":\"d29\",\"snippet\":\" ... Jigsaw was shortlisted for the 1989 Booker Prize.\\n\\nBedford was a German-born English writer and journalist. She was the author of 10 books, including a biography of Aldous Huxley, and four novels, which fictionalized her life. She was a recipient of the Golden PEN Award in 1993 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cbc.ca/books/30-books-to-celebrate-30-years-of-writers-company-1.5755144\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"f54841df494880f64a9b0c4e76f2a512d037639d65433f017671dade04863398\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"a0edbbeca8b95023b3b8aaf250a4f4df14b2a6181e34d768d4a7bf6812be560c\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Man Booker International 2016 shortlist A Whole Life Tram 83\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_69ae1064fa564e8cac0c9201"},{"content":"Current control state (data, not source evidence):\n{\"current_notes_not_evidence\":[],\"evidence_shelf\":{\"omitted_for_capacity\":[],\"restored_exact_windows\":[],\"selection\":\"bounded recent first-delivery order; not a relevance/verification judgment\"},\"feedback\":null,\"instruction\":\"Read only useful passages. Notes and all-page cleanup are optional.\",\"literal_answer_contract\":{\"origin\":\"explicit experiment configuration, not inferred from question\",\"prefix\":\"\",\"suffix\":\"\"},\"phase\":\"RESEARCH\",\"remaining\":{\"action_slots\":194,\"backend_calls\":104,\"model_calls\":12,\"output_reservation\":47409},\"research_workflow\":{\"active_gap_not_verified\":null,\"available_pages_not_ranked_for_relevance\":[{\"navigation